</head><body>
<div style="text-align:center;margin:24px 0"><img src="../_svg/multiplication_model.svg" alt="" style="max-width:95%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)"></div>
<div class="lf-page">
<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小三 · 第 21 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">Multiplication進階</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">三位數 x 一位數 · 進位要加返！· 65 min</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>核心Trap：</b>🪤 進位忘記加返！乘完十位後要加返百位嘅進位<br/>
<b>Prerequisites：</b>L05-L07 基本Multiplication · 1-10Multiplication表<br/>
<b>Lesson Objectives：</b>❶ 三位數 x 一位數直式 ❷ 進位處理 ❸ 有0的Multiplication ❹ Estimation驗證<br/>
<b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維》3下A冊 單元一
</div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div></div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up （5 min）（共 5 題）<span class="star">⭐</span></div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🏆 陷阱獵人·計時挑戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">每題限時90秒！搵出隱藏嘅陷阱，答對+1分，連續答對分數加倍！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⭐ 開始挑戰 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>23 x 3 = ？（先乘個位，再乘十位）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>45 x 2 = ？（十位有進位！）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>6 x 8 = ＿＿，60 x 8 = ＿＿（加一個零嘅秘密！）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>100 x 7 = ＿＿，200 x 4 = ＿＿</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>78 x 5，大概會係幾多？A. 約 200 B. 約 400 C. 約 800（提示：78≈80，80x5=?）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge （15 min） ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：三位數 x 一位數 — 直式基本功<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐ 最重要</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① <strong>步驟：</strong>個位 → 十位 → 百位，逐位乘！<br/>
② <strong>123 x 3：</strong>3x3=9（個位），2x3=6（十位），1x3=3（百位）→ <strong>369</strong><br/>
③ <strong>關鍵：</strong>每位乘完如果 ≥10，就要<strong>進位</strong>！<br/>
④ <strong>Mnemonic：</strong>「乘完寫個位，十位進上去，下一輪要加返！」
</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 1：冇進位（最簡單）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">🍬 每盒有 132 粒糖，買 3 盒共有幾粒？</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">直式：132 x 3<br/>個位：2x3=<strong>6</strong> | 十位：3x3=<strong>9</strong> | 百位：1x3=<strong>3</strong><br/>答案：<strong>396 粒</strong></div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 例題 2：有進位！（Trap重點）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">📦 每箱有 156 個橙，買 4 箱共有幾個？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ 小Trap怪獸話</div><div class="eq">156 x 4 = 424</div><div class="why">6x4=24（寫4進2），5x4=20，但忘記加進位2！</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確答案</div><div class="eq">156 x 4 = 624</div><div class="why">6x4=24（寫4進2）；5x4=20，<strong>20+2=22</strong>（寫2進2）；1x4=4，<strong>4+2=6</strong>；答案=624</div></div>
</div></div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 致命Trap：進位一定要加返！每次乘完之後，要加返低位進上嚟嘅數字！呢個係 P3 學生最容易錯嘅位！</div>
<div class="lf-tip">💡 小貼士：用螢光筆圈住進位數字，提醒自己一定要加返！</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>214 x 2 = ？（直式計算）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>328 x 3 = ？（注意進位！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>175 x 4 = ？（每步都有進位）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>263 x 5 = ？（直式 + Estimation驗證：約 260x5=1300）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：有「0」嘅Multiplication<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① <strong>中間有 0：</strong>105 x 3 = 315（0x3=0，唔可以漏！）<br/>
② <strong>尾有 0：</strong>240 x 3 = 720（先計 24x3=72，再加返個 0）<br/>
③ <strong>Trap：</strong>105 x 3，十位係0，但百位1x3=3要寫啱位！唔可以寫成 315？錯！係 315 ✓<br/>
④ <strong>祕技：</strong>尾有0 → 先當冇0咁乘，最後加返0！
</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 例題 3：中間有 0 嘅真正Trap</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q"><strong>108 x 5</strong> = ？（呢題先真正考到你！）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ 小Trap怪獸話</div><div class="eq">108 x 5 = 500</div><div class="why">跳過咗十位嘅 0！直接由 1x5=5，再計 8x5=40，寫成 500。漏咗 0x5=0 呢步，對位錯晒！</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確答案</div><div class="eq">108 x 5 = <strong>540</strong></div><div class="why">逐位乘：8x5=40（寫0進4）；0x5=0，0+<strong>4</strong>=4（寫4進0）；1x5=5。答案=<strong>540</strong>。每位都要乘，0嗰位都唔可以跳！</div></div>
</div>
<div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--gray);margin-top:6px;">⚠️ 中間有 0 嘅Trap：唔可以跳過任何位！就算係 0 都要乘（0 × 任何數 = 0），然後加返進位。跳咗一步就對錯位！</div></div></div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 重點：每次乘完要確認寫喺邊個位（個/十/百），有0嗰位都要乘，結果係0都要寫！</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點二 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>203 x 4 = ？（中間有0，要小心！）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>150 x 6 = ？（尾有0，用祕技快計！）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>305 x 7 = ？（中間和尾都有注意點）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：Estimation驗證法<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① 做完Multiplication，用<strong>Estimation</strong>檢查答案是否合理！<br/>
② 例：287 x 3 ≈ 300 x 3 = <strong>900</strong>，真正答案應該在 900 附近<br/>
③ 如果計到 621 或 1287，就知一定出錯！<br/>
④ EstimationMnemonic：<strong>「四捨五入變整數，乘完之後比較下！」</strong>
</div></div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、Tiered Practice （20 min）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌱 Foundation Tier（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>312 x 3 = ？（冇進位，逐位乘）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>241 x 2 = ？（直式）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td>120 x 4 = ？（尾有0，用祕技）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌿 Intermediate Tier（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td>186 x 3 = ？（有進位！用螢光筆圈住進位數字）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>275 x 4 = ？（雙重進位！Estimation：約 280x4=1120）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">18</td><td>判斷對錯：308 x 3 = 924。用Estimation驗證！</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌳 Challenge Tier（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">19</td><td>463 x 6 = ？（每步都有進位，考你細心！）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">20</td><td>一盒顏色筆有 128 支，學校買 7 盒。共有多少支？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">21</td><td>999 x 9 = ？（試下用 1000x9 - 1x9 呢個祕技！）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">四、生活Word Problems（共 5 題）<span class="star">🎯</span></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
