<tr><td class="lf-qn">23</td><td>🍎 一箱蘋果有 165 個，超級市場訂了 5 箱。共有多少個蘋果？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">24</td><td>📖 一本故事書有 248 頁，小明看完了 3 本。共看了多少頁？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">25</td><td>🚌 每架巴士可載 156 人，6 架巴士共可載多少人？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">26</td><td>🎮 一部遊戲機賣 875 元。小明儲了 3000 元，夠買 4 部嗎？差多少？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">五、Homework （課後完成）<span class="star">📝</span></div>
<div class="lf-h2">Foundation (Required)題（共 5 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
